  <section class="section" id="questions">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="kicker"><span class="kicker-num">07</span>Questions</p>
        <h2>The things people ask first.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq reveal">
        <details><summary>Can I sell data my customers created?</summary><p>It depends on your contracts and the tool&rsquo;s terms. The data buyer reviews this before any buyer sees the data.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is anonymized data safe to share?</summary><p>Removing names does not make data anonymous. Personal information gets its own review.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How much could my data be worth?</summary><p>Your company is paid by the buyer, and the figure sits in the agreement you sign, so it is in writing before anything moves. Value depends on the records, the rights and the terms, which is why <a href="market.html">what AI data sells for</a> uses the figures buyers publish rather than a number we would have to invent.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What fees apply?</summary><p>You pay us nothing for the introduction; the buyer pays us. Any fee in the agreement is set in writing before anything moves forward.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>It depends on the data and the rights review. We tell you the likely steps on the first call.</p></details>
      </div>
